<title>UK: DB Capital Markets sets warrants on dollar/mark.</title>
<headline>DB Capital Markets sets warrants on dollar/mark.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>DB Capital Markets has issued five million American-style call and put put warrants, in five equal tranches, on the U.S. dollar and mark exchange rate, lead manager Deutsche Bank AG said.</p>
<p>COMMON TERMS:</p>
<p> EXERCISE PERIOD 04.MAR.97-14.DEC.98   PAYDATE    04.MAR.97</p>
<p> LISTING	   FFURT, DUSS	     SPOT REF   1.6753 DEM</p>
<p>* * * * * * * * *</p>
<p> TYPE	   STRIKE	  ISSUE	  GEARING    PREMIUM</p>
<p> CALL	   1.80 DEM	3.39 DEM     49.42 X    9.47 PCT</p>
<p> CALL	   1.90 DEM	1.76 DEM     95.19 X    14.46 PCT</p>
<p> CALL	   2.00 DEM	0.91 DEM     184.1 X    19.92 PCT</p>
<p> PUT	    1.35 DEM	1.05 DEM     159.55 X   20.04 PCT</p>
<p> PUT	    1.45 DEM	2.73 DEM     61.37 X    15.08 PCT</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
